  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1757700501_8974286_45982bfa237024994f90a4b66ba6ac4a.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Brand Introduction:</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">AquaProVac is the leading innovator in professional-grade carpet extraction and steam cleaning equipment for both commercial and residential use. Since our founding, we have been committed to delivering powerful, efficient, and durable cleaning solutions that help professionals and homeowners achieve superior cleaning results. Our dedication to quality engineering and customer satisfaction has established us as a trusted name in the cleaning equipment industry.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Product Description:</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Our flagship products include:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">The AquaProVac Carpet Extractor</span></b></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Commercial-grade carpet cleaning system with powerful suction capabilities</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Removable water reservoirs for easy fill and empty</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Lightweight Ergonomic design for ease of use and maneuverability</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Multiple attachment options for versatile cleaning applications</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Durable construction designed for years of reliable performance</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">The Mobile Detailing Steamer</span></b></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Compact, professional-grade steam cleaner ideal for auto detailing</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Generates high-temperature, dry vapor steam for effective sanitizing</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Versatile applications including interior detailing, engine bays, and exterior trim</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Adjustable pressure controls for delicate surfaces</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Includes comprehensive attachment kit for reaching difficult areas</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">AquaProVac equipment stands out in the market for three primary reasons:</span></p>\r\n<ol type=\"1\" start=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Superior Performance</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">: Our machines deliver exceptional cleaning power and extraction capability, outperforming similarly priced competitors</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Professional Results at Consumer Prices</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">: We offer commercial-grade quality accessible to both professionals and serious DIY enthusiasts</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Durability and Reliability</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">: Built with heavy-duty components and backed by industry-leading warranties, our equipment represents a smart long-term investment</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Payment Terms:</span></b></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">5% commission on all sales generated through affiliate links</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">30-day cookie duration to capture return visitors</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Monthly payments via PayPal or direct deposit</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Minimum payout threshold of $50</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Bonus commission structure available for affiliates generating over $5,000 in monthly sales</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Performance incentives including increased commission rates for consistent top performers</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Other Information:</span></b></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; margin-top: 0px;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Comprehensive marketing materials provided, including high-quality product images, demo videos, and pre-written content</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Dedicated affiliate support manager assigned to each partner</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Regular product training webinars available for affiliates</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Exclusive early access to new product launches and promotional events</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Opportunity for featured placement on our website for top-performing affiliates</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Strict compliance with FTC disclosure requirements</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">No competing affiliate links allowed in the same content</span></li>\r\n</ul>",
